' --- 1. High-Level System Flow (Activity Diagram) ---
title NCS Analyzer — High-Level System Flow

start

:Admin / Asesor Login;
:Select Employee;
:Create Assessment;

:Employee Consent;
if (Consent Approved?) then (yes)
  :Generate QR Code;
  :Employee Scan QR;
  :Validate Session Token;
else (no / expired)
  :Assessment Cancelled / Expired;
  stop
endif

:Session Active;

fork
  :Visual Forensic (Screen Casting);
  :OCR / AI Detection;
  :Apply Visual Rules;
fork again
  :JSON Upload + Queue;
  :Parse Activity Log;
  :Apply Log Rules;
end fork

:Finding Integration;
:Risk Score Engine;
:Generate Risk Profile & Report;

if (Retention Expired?) then (yes)
  :Auto-Wipe Raw Data;
else (no)
  :Keep Raw Data;
endif

stop

' --- 2. Assessment State Machine ---
title Assessment Status State Machine

[*] --> PENDING
PENDING --> CONSENT : Consent required
CONSENT --> ACTIVE : Employee approves
ACTIVE --> PROCESSING : Session active + processing
PROCESSING --> COMPLETED : All findings + risk calculated

PENDING --> CANCELLED : Asesor cancels
PENDING --> EXPIRED : Timeout before consent
ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : Asesor stops session

note right of EXPIRED
  Can be revived only by
  creating new assessment
end note

' --- 3. Session State Machine ---
title Session Status State Machine

[*] --> PENDING
PENDING --> ACTIVE : QR scanned + token valid
ACTIVE --> PROCESSING : Data flowing (OCR/JSON)
PROCESSING --> COMPLETED : Assessment finished

ACTIVE --> DISCONNECTED : Client disconnect
DISCONNECTED --> ACTIVE : Auto-reconnect (within 30s)
DISCONNECTED --> EXPIRED : Idle timeout (30 min)
ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : Session timeout (4h)
PENDING --> EXPIRED : QR token expired (10 min)
ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : Manual stop

' --- 4. Visual Forensic Flow ---
title Visual Forensic Flow

start

:Screen Casting active;
:Capture Screen Frame;

fork
  :OCR (extract text);
  :AI Detection (object/logo/app);
fork again
end fork

:Apply Detection Rules;

if (Rule matched?) then (yes)
  :Create Visual Finding;
  :Record: type, value, confidence, severity, timestamp;
else (no)
  :Ignore frame;
endif

note bottom
  Output stored in visual_findings table.
  Confidence threshold configurable per rule.
end note

stop

' --- 5. Data Forensic Flow ---
title Data Forensic Flow

start

:Employee / Agent upload JSON;
:Validate file (format + size);
:Store file securely;
:Dispatch ProcessActivityLog Job;

:Parse JSON;
:Save Activity Log records;
:Run Detection Rules against logs;

if (Rule matched?) then (yes)
  :Create Log Finding;
  :Link activity_log_id + rule_id;
else (no)
  :Ignore record;
endif

note bottom
  Heavy JSON (>10MB) must NOT be processed
  inline in HTTP request. Always via Queue.
end note

stop

' --- 6. Risk Score Engine Flow ---
title Risk Score Engine Flow

start

:Collect Visual Findings;
:Collect Log Findings;

:Apply severity weights;
:Apply rule risk_weight;
:Sum visual_score + log_score;

if (total <= LOW threshold?) then (yes)
  :Risk Level = LOW;
elseif (total <= MEDIUM threshold?) then (yes)
  :Risk Level = MEDIUM;
else
  :Risk Level = HIGH;
endif

:Store risk_scores record;
:Broadcast RiskScoreCalculated event;

note right
  Thresholds configurable
  berdasarkan metodologi resmi.
end note

stop

' --- 7. Consent & QR Session Flow ---
title Consent & QR Session Flow

start

:Assessment Created (status = consent);
:Employee notified;
:Employee reads consent document;

if (Employee approves?) then (yes)
  :Record Consent (version, timestamp, IP, signature);
  :Create Session;
  :Generate QR Code (token, expires 10 min);
  :Employee scans QR;
  :Validate session token;
  :Session status = ACTIVE;
else (no)
  :Assessment = CANCELLED;
  stop
endif

:Session monitoring;
:Collect findings (visual + data);

if (Session ended by asesor?) then (yes)
  :Session = COMPLETED;
else
  :Session = EXPIRED / CANCELLED;
endif

stop

' --- 8. Report & Auto-Wipe Flow ---
title Report Generation & Raw Data Retention

start

:Assessment COMPLETED;

fork
  :Generate Report (PDF / JSON);
  :Store report_path;
fork again
  :Start Retention Timer (30 days default);
end fork

:Broadcast AssessmentCompleted event;

:Wait retention period;

if (Retention expired?) then (yes)
  :Dispatch WipeRawData Job;
  :Delete raw JSON, frames, OCR/AI raw output;
  :Keep: findings, risk_score, report;
  :Audit log: Wipe Raw Data;
else (no)
  :Raw data retained securely;
endif

stop

' --- Legend ---
legend right
  = Legend =
  [*] = initial/final state
  --> = transition
  (yes)/(no) = decision branch
  note = additional detail
end legend

